WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.442
"Good-bye, Wizard," the knight said.

2
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:21.770
Tom slammed the door shut after him.

3
00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:25.491
He did not want to help that bad knight.

4
00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:30.384
Cat was licking her paws.

5
00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:36.278
"What should I do, Cat?" Tom asked.

6
00:00:36.279 --> 00:00:42.260
"I'll talk to the horse," she said.

7
00:00:42.261 --> 00:00:51.508
That night Tom went to the jousting field.

8
00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:57.237
The knight rode in on his horse.

9
00:00:57.238 --> 00:01:00.525
"Whoa!" cried the knight.

10
00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:10.678
The horse threw him off her back!

11
00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:15.118
"This is a terrible horse!" the knight said.

12
00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:20.099
He looked furious.

13
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.597
"She never obeys me."

14
00:01:24.598 --> 00:01:28.418
"Are you ready for the spell?" Tom asked.

15
00:01:28.419 --> 00:01:31.113
"Ha-ha!" The knight laughed.

16
00:01:31.114 --> 00:01:34.283
"Of course I'm ready, you fool.

17
00:01:34.284 --> 00:01:41.920
I want to win all the prize money!"

18
00:01:41.921 --> 00:01:46.772
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

19
00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:50.897
The field filled with smoke.

20
00:01:50.898 --> 00:02:01.073
Cat sneaked over to talk to the horse.

21
00:02:01.074 --> 00:02:04.993
A few minutes later the smoke cleared.

22
00:02:04.994 --> 00:02:08.867
"I did the spell," Tom said.

23
00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:15.472
"Good," the bad knight said.

24
00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:20.843
He got back on his horse.

25
00:02:20.844 --> 00:02:29.952
The knight rode up and down the field.

26
00:02:29.953 --> 00:02:39.096
This time the horse did not throw off the knight.

27
00:02:39.097 --> 00:02:42.251
This time the horse obeyed.

28
00:02:42.252 --> 00:02:47.646
"Your spell worked, Wizard!" the knight said.

29
00:02:47.647 --> 00:02:50.017
His grin was greedy.

30
00:02:50.018 --> 00:03:12.268
"The prize money is all mine!"

